                    <div class="value-card glass-card text-center rounded-4">
                        <div class="value-icon mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-handshake fa-2x text-primary"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Trust & Transparency</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">
                            We believe in building lasting relationships through honesty, transparency, and open communication with our clients.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="value-card glass-card text-center rounded-4">
                        <div class="value-icon mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-lightbulb fa-2x text-warning"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Innovation</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">
                            We continuously innovate our platform and services to provide the best possible experience for our users.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="col-lg-4">
                    <div class="value-card glass-card text-center rounded-4">
                        <div class="value-icon mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-users fa-2x text-success"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Customer First</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted">
                            Every decision we make is centered around providing exceptional value and service to our customers.
                        </p>
